CE9B 3406             (    forth6809.asm):02591                     PSHS  D
CE9D DC04             (    forth6809.asm):02592                     LDD   LATEST
CE9F 3406             (    forth6809.asm):02593                     PSHS  D
                      (    forth6809.asm):02594         
CEA1 CCD2FF           (    forth6809.asm):02595                     LDD   #INTERPRET
