                      (    forth6809.asm):09512         ; SECTION 28: DISASSEMBLER AND DECOMPILER (DASM, DIS, SEE)
                      (    forth6809.asm):09513         ; ============================================================
                      (    forth6809.asm):09514         ; Optional: DISASM adds DASM and DIS, DECOMP adds SEE (which needs
                      (    forth6809.asm):09515         ; DISASM). Design notes: see shadow DISASM.1 and DECOMP.1.
